; 5_voice_lets_go — SSG voice approximation: "LET'S GO!"
;
; Two-syllable rising cue with consonant noise bursts.

T220
V13
O5
L64

; "L-" + "ETS" vowel glide              (~280 ms)
P3 D E F
P0 G G+ A A A B A G F+ E
P3 R64

; "G-" + "O!" long descending vowel     (~400 ms)
